{"assets":["/statement-assets/baa30b3296a962a9ca1c74591375dbc4864d744218cdbbf2e5159e9195bb6cae.png","/statement-assets/1f0c15601db0fd8c8cf57b19fef53a97c44ae52c8d3e0a31b1e5803b07be8ea2.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2216","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. THU Packing Puzzle"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are three types of 2D blocks: T-shaped, H-shaped, and U-shaped. Their exact shapes are shown in the figure below:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/baa30b3296a962a9ca1c74591375dbc4864d744218cdbbf2e5159e9195bb6cae.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given three non-negative integers $$$c_T$$$, $$$c_H$$$, and $$$c_U$$$, representing the numbers of T-shaped, H-shaped, and U-shaped blocks, respectively. Your task is to pack all $$$(c_T + c_H + c_U)$$$ blocks into an $$$n \\times 3$$$ grid, following these rules:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Every block must be placed entirely inside the grid; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" No two blocks may overlap (i.e., no unit cell can be covered by more than one block); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Blocks can be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"rotated"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" by any multiple of $$$90^{\\circ}$$$, but their edges must remain parallel to the grid borders. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to find the minimum possible value of $$$n$$$ for which such a packing exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of each test case contains three integers $$$c_T$$$, $$$c_H$$$, and $$$c_U$$$ ($$$0\\le c_T,c_H,c_U\\le 10^9$$$, $$$c_T+c_H+c_U \\gt 0$$$) — the numbers of T-shaped, H-shaped, and U-shaped blocks, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the minimum possible value of $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 1 1\n2 0 0\n1 1 0\n0 0 1000000000\n1000000000 1000000000 1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n5\n5\n3000000000\n7000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The optimal solutions for the first three test cases are listed below:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/1f0c15601db0fd8c8cf57b19fef53a97c44ae52c8d3e0a31b1e5803b07be8ea2.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"2216B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2216/problem/B"}